                <pb facs="0139" n="19" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg19"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of State of
                            Luxemburg to Chargé Garrett.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-02"><hi rendition="#italic">July 2,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Hereditary Grand Duke and myself sympathize most keenly in the great loss
                    which your country has sustained, and which is doubly painful at the present
                    moment. We express to you our deep condolences.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eyschen.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
